{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41921","headline":"吉水春暮访蔡文庆处士留题 · 李中","name":"吉水春暮访蔡文庆处士留题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无事无忧鬓任苍，浊醪闲酌送韶光。\n溟蒙雨过池塘暖，狼藉花飞砚席香。\n好古未尝疎典册，悬图时要看潇湘。\n恋君清话难留处，归路迢迢又夕阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}